{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/28/7699267/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"上の写真、昨日家帰ったあと\nメイク足してみて撮ってみた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/28/7699267/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふふ\nわかりにくいけど、ちょっと違うの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろんなメイクしたいなー\nいろんな衣装着たいなー\n楽しいだろうなあ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マッサージチェアってすごいね。\nびっくりしたわー\n全身のボタン押したら\n手までやってくれたわ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/28/7699267/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お仕事の待ち時間に、\nあったので使ってみたのよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とても贅沢な気持ちだった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"***********"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/28/7699267/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好き嫌い多い方？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/28/7699267/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"多いよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/28/7699267/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/28/7699267/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分で思う欠点とか、\n自分の嫌いなところはありますか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/28/7699267/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありまくりです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/28/7699267/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本屋さんではどんな本読んでたの？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/28/7699267/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雑誌とか雑誌とか小説とか..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/28/7699267/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっかのバイト経験は？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/28/7699267/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ないんです。\nレジうちやってみたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/28/7699267/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"口癖教えてー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/28/7699267/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あーこうやって言われると\n忘れちゃう！というかわからんなあ。\n手を顔の近くに置いちゃう癖は\nあるけど、口癖...なんだろ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/28/7699267/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きな食べ物はなんぞや？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/28/7699267/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いっぱいあるんですが、\nピーマン、生姜、いちご、魚\n...ここまで絞りました！！←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てか魚ってざっくり過ぎるね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/28/7699267/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントしてくれた子の名前\nって覚えてくれるの？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/28/7699267/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメント読みながら\nあ、いつもコメントしてくれる方だ\nって思います"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/28/7699267/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもありがとうございます♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/28/7699267/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中華料理何が好きなの!?\nデザート系以外ね~＼(^_^)／"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/28/7699267/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"青椒肉絲！酢豚！小籠包！\nあとカシューナッツ炒め？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/28/7699267/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"フレンチかイタリアンか中華か\n和食だったらどれが1番好きですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/28/7699267/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全部すきなのですが...\nんー最終的にはやっぱり和食。\n日本人だもの...！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日FMヨコハマ「tre-sen」に\n若月、あみと生出演します！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりのラジオ嬉しい！\n頑張りますっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/28/7699267/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お仕事の前に友達と遊んだんだ♪\n生姜料理美味やったね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/28/7699267/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写真は友達に撮ってもらったよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/28/7699267/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"桜きれいだなあ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}